Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:01.64,0:00:06.90,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThis is a tale of\Nadventure, 25 years in the past.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.62,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NIt begins not long\Nbefore the Great Pirate Era
Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.62,0:00:18.95,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,that we know of today.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:48.25,0:00:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.55,0:00:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good ale and blue\Nskies! What a day!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.51,0:01:00.56,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Roger Pirates cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:00.56,0:01:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a joy traveling\Nthese seas with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.68,0:01:05.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Roger.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.23,0:01:08.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOLD ROGER]\NHm? What are you\Ngoing on about, ya big dope?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.74,0:01:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden, we should be thanking you!\NThe whole stinking crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Gold Roger chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.58,0:01:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're drinking too much\Nagain! Dial it back!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:29.59,0:01:33.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe if my doctor wasn't\Nso drunk, I'd listen to him!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:33.67,0:01:35.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[both growling]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.47,0:01:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well I'm drunk and I'm concerned\Nabout your health, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Gold Roger groans]\NBastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.25,0:01:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a cure for stupidity.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.71,0:01:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! You need it, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.04,0:01:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Gold Roger laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.33,0:01:48.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Crocus groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.38,0:01:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(711,1053)}- [thud]\N- [Crocus groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.80,0:01:49.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOLD ROGER]\NWant some more?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.93,0:02:02.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I must return soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.68,0:02:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the Land of Wano?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.72,0:02:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ODEN]\NYes. There is work left undone.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it feels like\Ntoo much to handle,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.36,0:02:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you don't have to tackle it\Non your own, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BUGGY]\NIf you need a hand, Oden,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.78,0:02:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then this clown will never\Nlet you down! Promise!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.90,0:02:20.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHANKS]\NYeah, right!\NYou'll be dead weight!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't kid yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.62,0:02:23.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, how 'bout this?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.08,0:02:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll come along too\Nand keep him in check!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.42,0:02:35.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am grateful. But, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.67,0:02:40.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki must accomplish\Nthis task alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the last time,\Nwhy is he "Taro" and I'm "Jiro"?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.97,0:02:45.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause only the cool kids\Nget to be "Taro." [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.96,0:02:48.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Then It's personal.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.31,0:02:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This journey taught me much
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.73,0:02:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm grateful to\Nhave seen the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.77,0:02:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have long questioned why\Nmy country closed its borders.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.78,0:03:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I left the Land of Wano\Nby my own choice,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I won't be\Nso selfish as to ask
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that they make me\NShogun when I return.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.95,0:03:11.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I will fight for my cause\Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.00,0:03:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ODEN]\NWith the aid of\Nmy faithful retainers,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.42,0:03:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,doubtless awaiting my return,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall open up\Nthe Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Together, we shall await\Nthe coming of a new world,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.89,0:03:26.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in 20 years!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Roger Pirates cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.43,0:03:35.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We shall not fail, Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.06,0:03:43.19,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NNow, in the\NLand of Wano, 25 years later.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Orochi chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our lord is truly blessed.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.77,0:04:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even the weather itself\Nshows him its favor.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.65,0:04:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro will look after\Nthe capital and remain here.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.71,0:04:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Townspeople cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, deliver\Nthe message, quickly.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.74,0:04:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SUBORDINATE A]\NYes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.03,0:04:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, the poor guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.57,0:04:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be sad he's\Ngonna miss the party!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.49,0:04:16.45,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThis is Habu Port,\Nlocated in Hakumai.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.75,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It is the largest port\Nin the Land of Wano
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.75,0:04:21.21,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and the most scenic as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.21,0:04:23.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Maple trees line\Nits massive wharf,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.92,0:04:27.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,framing the entrance to the sea\Nwith a splash of colors.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.38,0:04:29.55,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The red and orange leaves\Nfluttering through the air
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.55,0:04:33.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,give a festive sendoff to\Nthe boats as they depart.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's start the party!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.77,0:04:39.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring some saké!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.10,0:04:41.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should drink and\Nadmire the scenery!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.35,0:04:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi, perhaps wait\Ntill you see Kaido?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.02,0:04:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He doesn't care!\NY'think he's not drunk, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.44,0:04:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a banquet\Nwith 30,000 guests!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.20,0:04:55.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're here to have a good time!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.20,0:04:57.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NOn the night\Nof the annual Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.29,0:04:59.46,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the two leaders who\Nrule the Land of Wano
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.46,0:05:02.21,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,come together on\Nthe island of Onigashima.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,There they throw\Na lavish banquet,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.71,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,attended by all of Kaido's army
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.71,0:05:08.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and all of Orochi's\Narmy as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.30,0:05:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Townspeople chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.39,0:05:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Children giggling]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GIRL A]\NHey! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.20,0:06:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON A]\NWhen you need\Na break from dancing,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.29,0:06:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,eat up! Drink up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.04,0:06:59.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And when you're done, get out\Nthere and dance some more!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.38,0:07:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Children giggling]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.09,0:07:01.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON B]\NIt's the only\Nday we're allowed to drink!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.38,0:07:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better believe I'm gonna\Nsavor every last drop of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.31,0:07:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we go already?\NYou look fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.48,0:07:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! My bangs\Nare just not working.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.10,0:07:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh my! The sky is\Nso clear tonight!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.27,0:07:19.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should have a view of\Nthe full moon in just a bit!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.61,0:07:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Townsperson E giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.61,0:07:24.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Children laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.98,0:07:27.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NIn the Land of Wano,\Neach region has
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.36,0:07:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,different seasons at\Ndifferent times of the year.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.62,0:07:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Townsperson E giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.53,0:07:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weather also varies\Ntremendously by location.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sunny skies in\None region turn to
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.45,0:07:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,foreboding clouds in the next.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThus, the rendezvous\Npoint at Tokage Port
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.38,0:07:45.00,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,looked quite different\Nfrom the capital.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.66,0:08:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is nary a single\Nship in sight!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.74,0:08:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nary a single\Nship in sight!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.66,0:08:14.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our 4,000 warriors\Nare missing, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.70,0:08:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our 4,000 warriors\Nare missing, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.16,0:08:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OKIKU]\NHow could this be?\NWe conquered Udon!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.50,0:08:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our men, they left\Nthe labor camp.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So where could they be now?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.80,0:08:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glancing around, there are signs\Nthat the port was attacked!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.86,0:08:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glancing around, there are signs\Nthat the port was attacked!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.84,0:08:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It appears the cat\Ncouldn't make it in time.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NThe Smail is not responding.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.32,0:08:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever has happened,\Nwe cannot contact anyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.57,0:08:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\N"Twilight on\Nthe day of the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.65,0:08:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At twilight on the day\Nof the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.51,0:08:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\N"Twilight on\Nthe day of the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.03,0:08:54.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at Tokage Port"!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.81,0:08:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at Tokage Port"!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.85,0:08:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NThis is the rendezvous point,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.99,0:08:58.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NThis is the rendezvous point,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.08,0:08:59.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NThis is the rendezvous point,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.31,0:08:59.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without a doubt!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.53,0:08:59.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without a doubt!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without a doubt!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.11,0:09:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't anyone come?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.28,0:09:01.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't anyone come?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.46,0:09:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't anyone come?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.32,0:09:03.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where could they\Nhave disappeared to?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.58,0:09:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where could they have\Ndisappeared to?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.21,0:09:10.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NOnly a day has passed!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.63,0:09:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What could have befallen them?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.05,0:09:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NWhat is going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.27,0:09:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Children gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.40,0:09:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy, where have you gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.59,0:09:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NSir Luffy, where have you gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.07,0:09:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Hyogoro, please answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.42,0:09:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Hyogoro, please answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.81,0:09:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NDogstorm's Musketeers!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.27,0:09:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir Law!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.08,0:09:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are the retainers\Nof Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.48,0:09:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are the retainers\Nof Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.17,0:09:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've come to settle the past!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.52,0:09:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've come to settle the past!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.86,0:09:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NTwenty years ago,\Nwe failed to save our lord,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.01,0:09:47.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NTwenty years ago,\Nwe failed to save our lord,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.16,0:09:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and because we could not\Ndie by his side that day,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.26,0:09:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and because we could not\Ndie by his side that day,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.43,0:09:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we offer up our lives now,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.45,0:09:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we offer up our lives now,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.18,0:09:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in hopes of seeing justice\Nserved at long last!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.25,0:09:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in hopes of seeing justice\Nserved at long last!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.46,0:09:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, I must profess that\Nour lives are not enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.46,0:10:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, I must profess\Nthat our lives are not enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.57,0:10:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy has 30,000 soldiers!\NWe need help!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.18,0:10:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy has 30,000 soldiers!\NWe need help!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.51,0:10:09.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.81,0:10:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without your aid,\Nwe shall all die in vain!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.85,0:10:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without your aid,\Nwe shall all die in vain!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.02,0:10:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, answer me! Help us...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.46,0:10:15.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, answer me! Help us...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.76,0:10:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHUTENMARU]\NKin'emon, stop! Enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.97,0:10:19.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Orochi cackling]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.44,0:10:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! This sky and this sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.87,0:10:23.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heaven itself has abandoned us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.94,0:10:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heaven itself has abandoned us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.95,0:10:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll find no aid from\Nany place...from any man!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll find no aid from\Nany place, from any man!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.91,0:10:34.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something terrible must have\Nhappened to our friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.58,0:10:41.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Children gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.75,0:10:43.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PERFORMER A]\NWatch out, comin' through!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.12,0:10:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there,\Ndance with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.34,0:10:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the one time of the year\Nyou get to let loose!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody start\Nmoving those feet!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.14,0:10:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DOGSTORM]\NThere's a small\Nboat here. We can use it.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.36,0:11:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOMONOSUKE]\NThat's ridiculous, Dogstorm!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you saying?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.32,0:11:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll delay the plan! We must!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.65,0:11:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, that is not\Nan option, my lord.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.54,0:11:16.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master Kin!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.75,0:11:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, stop this.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.09,0:11:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't!\NThis is doomed to fail!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.42,0:11:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NAnd yet it must be done.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.14,0:11:30.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know this as well as I do.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.60,0:11:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Orochi cackling]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NIt must be tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.19,0:11:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Orochi cackling]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.66,0:11:47.70,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe night before the festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.45,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe night before the festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.45,0:11:49.54,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi had already\Nthwarted their plans.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.54,0:11:53.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi had already\Nthwarted their plans.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.19,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\Nbefore the Fire Festival...-OG}[NARRATOR]\NTwo days\Nbefore the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.19,0:11:57.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,774)\Nbefore the Fire Festival...-OG}when hope still remained.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.00,0:12:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Splendid. We now have\N4,200 soldiers.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.80,0:12:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm stunned. It's a miracle\Nthat they have joined us!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.89,0:12:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attention, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.14,0:12:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all of\Nyour hard work!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.20,0:12:12.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use the remaining time\Nfor preparations and travel!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.43,0:12:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please use the remaining time\Nfor preparations and travel!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.31,0:12:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll meet at\Nthe rendezvous port!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.10,0:12:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Soldiers cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.37,0:12:33.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta move 5,000 troops,\Nso get those ships in shape!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKERS]\NYessir!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.16,0:12:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perfect! You know\Nthe rendezvous port,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.12,0:12:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you know the time to be there,\Ncan you dig it?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.17,0:12:41.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem!\NWe'll see you there, for sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.67,0:12:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 100,0:12:43.26,0:12:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,1,,{\an8}[USOPP]\NThen, we'll split for now.
Dialogue: 100,0:12:44.71,0:12:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,1,,{\an8}We're meeting up with our\Nfriends in Amigasa Village.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the day of the festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.26,0:12:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll sail into battle\Non the Sunny!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other boats are up to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.43,0:12:54.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it! We'll work hard\Nand work fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.93,0:12:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You taught us a lot.\NYou're awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.35,0:12:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido won't even\Nknow what hit him!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.61,0:13:04.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just two more days and\Nwe're gonna kick some ass!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.82,0:13:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[workers cheer]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.28,0:13:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKER A]\NWe don't have enough timber!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut up anything made of\Nwood that you can find!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.24,0:13:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can count on Ocho's\Ngroup to bring swords
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.58,0:13:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and other weapons\Nfrom Ringo. What's next?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.37,0:13:21.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll put together some armor\Nfrom the enemies supplies!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.25,0:13:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKER C]\NI don't know\Nif we can use these or not,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the factory here still has\Na ton of heavy weapons
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.76,0:13:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they were going to sell.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.09,0:13:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.59,0:13:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we arrive at\Nthe meeting place early,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.59,0:13:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then we might draw too much\Nattention to ourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.51,0:13:36.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look. That morning,\Nthe shogun's procession
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.06,0:13:38.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will travel to the port\Nalong this path.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.85,0:13:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But as soon as the\Nshogun's ship leaves,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,everyone in the capital\Nwill start partying.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.82,0:13:46.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once they're distracted,\Nthen we gather.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.65,0:13:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Easy enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.90,0:13:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get there\Nright before twilight,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.70,0:13:51.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the second hour of the bird.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some officials are\Nstaying on the mainland,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we have to be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.91,0:13:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't let them\Nreport to Onigashima!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.58,0:13:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silence them if you have to!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.23,0:14:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp'll be jealous\Nwhen he sees this!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.36,0:14:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be samurai!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.02,0:14:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.80,0:14:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really okay to take these?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This one's cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.59,0:14:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Brook laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.56,0:14:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are up against Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.19,0:14:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you certain\Nyou are prepared for this?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.90,0:14:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That loser? He can't stop me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.74,0:14:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll slice Kaido in half!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.86,0:14:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't come all this\Nway just to lose!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.49,0:14:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My blade hungers for victory!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.45,0:14:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy, Brook, Chopper grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.96,0:14:41.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They make such awesome samurai!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.13,0:14:43.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[both]\NLike bugs? C-Cute?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're cute! Like bugs!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.47,0:14:44.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should really\Nwear some armor, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're Horned beetles!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.02,0:14:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that stuff slows me down.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.31,0:14:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Zoro growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(650.5,1053)}– [SANJI] You need it.\N– [ZORO] Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.60,0:14:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys with the low\Nbounties are frail.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.07,0:15:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Sanji groans]\NDon't you test\Nme! I'll put a boat up your ass!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.29,0:15:07.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead! Try!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you idiots doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.71,0:15:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, its winter at\Nthe entrance of Onigashima.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.55,0:15:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Orochi said.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it'll be cold?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.97,0:15:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what do you-gara\Nmean by "entrance"?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.64,0:15:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe Onigashima has\Nunpredictable weather
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like the rest of Wano?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either way, the cold\Nshouldn't be a problem,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.35,0:15:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since we're covered in fur.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.98,0:15:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}True. Tis not the season\Nthat's our concern.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.73,0:15:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's the forecast!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.82,0:15:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GIOVANNI]\NThere's supposed to\Nbe a full moon that night,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.03,0:15:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but if it's hidden behind\Nthe clouds, that won't help us.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.70,0:15:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.07,0:15:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If all the other Minks\Ntransform like you,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.08,0:15:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then this raid will be\Na walk in the park!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CARROT, WANDA]\N– Garchu!\N– Garchu!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.64,0:16:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our transformations are\Nalways a bit of a gamble.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.80,0:16:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Master Cat Viper and\Nthe Guardians arrive in time,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.60,0:16:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're still going to be the\Ngreatest asset that we've got.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.56,0:16:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat's wrong, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.15,0:16:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It bugs me that Big Mom is here.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.99,0:16:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause Jinbe hasn't\Nshown up yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.96,0:16:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's extra bad\Nsince he's the one
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who fought her\Nso we could escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.29,0:16:31.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you in Wano!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.54,0:16:33.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You better show up!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.59,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,My deepest gratitude.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.09,0:16:42.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't die no matter what,\Ngot it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.39,0:16:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He settled things with Big Mom.\NHe was gonna join our crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.32,0:17:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NAnd we'll be happy to have him.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.99,0:17:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've still got\Nsome time. He'll come.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't die.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.16,0:17:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.50,0:17:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be here!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.67,0:17:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON C]\NHey guys, come look!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.04,0:17:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got a gift from\NUshimitsu Kozo!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.84,0:17:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON D]\NI didn't hear\Nabout a robbery in the capital.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.72,0:17:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever the story is,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's the only person\Nwho would do this.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.51,0:17:29.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shame we can't take part\Nin the Fire Festival,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.31,0:17:31.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now we can least\Nbuy fresh water!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.78,0:17:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HOLDEM]\NWe burned down\Nthe bandit's hideout
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HOLDEM]\NWe burned down\Nthe bandit's hideout
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.78,0:17:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause they stole our food.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause they stole our food.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.49,0:17:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd come\Nseeking revenge
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.65,0:17:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd come seeking\Nrevenge, and we'd wipe them out,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.03,0:17:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we'd wipe them out,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.58,0:17:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but instead, they keep stealing\Nmore food than ever before.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.65,0:17:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but instead they keep stealing\Nmore food than ever before!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kamijiro growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.66,0:17:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking you might have\Nsomething to do with all this!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.95,0:17:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking you might have\Nsomething to do with all this!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.87,0:17:48.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We-We don't know anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We-We don't know anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.87,0:17:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON F]\NI heard an army of samurai
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.08,0:17:52.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON F]\NI heard an army of samurai are
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.37,0:17:52.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are planning to make a big raid.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.62,0:17:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,planning to make a big raid.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.37,0:17:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's why\Nthey're stealing food?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's why\Nthey're stealing food?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.67,0:17:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but don't\Nlet him hear that!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.83,0:17:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but don't\Nlet him hear that!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.00,0:17:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, what are you\Nmuttering about?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.08,0:18:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, what are you\Nmuttering about?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.46,0:18:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.17,0:18:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please allow me! I'll show you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.17,0:18:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me! I'll show you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.51,0:18:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There is no need for any\Nof these people to be hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.51,0:18:09.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There is no need for any of\Nthese people to be hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.35,0:18:10.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON H]\NOtsuru!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.01,0:18:10.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON H]\NOtsuru!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.76,0:18:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Show me"?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.35,0:18:13.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Show me"?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.60,0:18:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you know\Nwhat happened to the food?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.27,0:18:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you know\Nwhat happened to the food?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.19,0:18:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll see once we get there.\NIt's a bit far, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.73,0:18:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll see once we get there.\NIt's a bit far, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.11,0:18:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.66,0:18:28.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTSURU]\NIf you need that much food,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.41,0:18:31.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,you must have\Nrecruited many allies.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You're here, aren't you, Kin?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.62,0:18:36.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You've returned to\Nthe Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.71,0:18:39.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2066,0,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}I was stunned\Nwhen I saw Kikunojo.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.30,0:18:45.76,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTSURU]\NDon't worry, Kin.\NYou can rely on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.76,0:18:48.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I will draw the attention\Nof our enemies!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.13,0:18:52.47,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Your secret is safe!\NI won't let them find you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.85,0:18:54.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Save this country!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.59,0:18:54.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2103,0,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}the end, you will die as\Na member of the Kozuki Clan,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.85,0:18:58.35,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2103,0,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Bring back the glory\Nof the Kozuki Clan!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.66,0:18:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON I]\NOtsuru, stop this!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.14,0:19:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON I]\NOtsuru, stop this!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.24,0:19:00.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to cover for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.69,0:19:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to cover for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.49,0:19:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON J]\NIt's all right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.02,0:19:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON J]\NIt's all right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.04,0:19:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we wanted was to eat our\Nfill even once before we died!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.61,0:19:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we wanted was to eat our\Nfill, even once, before we died!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.82,0:19:08.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.86,0:19:08.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.99,0:19:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Does that mean\Nyou bastards did it?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.12,0:19:12.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you\Nbastards did it?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.64,0:19:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groaning]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.85,0:19:22.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3111,0,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}You can say hello\Nto your lord in hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.94,0:19:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3111,0,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}You can all say hello\Nto your lord in hell!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.58,0:19:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OROCHI]\NDid you find the ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.68,0:19:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you find the ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.97,0:19:29.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OROCHI]\NDid you find the ship?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.99,0:19:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIRD GIFTER A]\NYes, sir.\NIt's in sight right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.14,0:19:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIRD GIFTER A]\NYes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.48,0:19:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIRD GIFTER A]\NYes, sir.\NIt's in sight right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.48,0:19:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure you want us to\Nlet loose on this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure you want us to\Nlet loose on this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.61,0:19:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you to do it,\Nso do it already! Burn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.13,0:19:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you to do it,\Nso do it already!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.38,0:19:45.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.39,0:20:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BIRD GIFTER A]\NMission complete!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.77,0:20:05.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckling]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.81,0:20:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really thought I'd\Nlet you have your way?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.40,0:20:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the shogun!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.65,0:20:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, the bridges!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.53,0:20:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kibi and Udon\Nhas been destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stop there!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.37,0:20:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE B]\NThe great bridge between
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.38,0:20:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE A]\NThe great bridge between
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.41,0:20:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuri and Udon\Nhas been destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what you get!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.08,0:20:29.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOLDIER A]\NWhat the hell happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.38,0:20:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone just blew up the bridge!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.05,0:20:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't get to the other side.\NSomething's wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.72,0:20:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy must have\Ndiscovered our plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.05,0:20:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that remains is the port!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE C]\NWe destroyed\Nevery ship in the port,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.56,0:20:43.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as you ordered, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.81,0:20:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OROCHI]\NExcellent.\NWe'll rebuild everything
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.10,0:20:47.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,once this is over.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.48,0:20:50.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I've yet to\Nsee the Akazaya samurai
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.73,0:20:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or any of the troops\Nthey've recruited,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.65,0:20:56.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I know they're out there.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.07,0:20:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The tale of the samurai\Nwho traveled through time
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.99,0:21:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from 20 years in the past!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.37,0:21:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course no one\Nbelieved that story!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.79,0:21:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But perhaps they will when I\Nshow them one of their heads.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.71,0:21:13.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, even if I did show them,\Nit's too strange to believe.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.76,0:21:16.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yasuie knew exactly\Nwhat he was doing!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.63,0:21:20.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He made it sound\Neven more ridiculous!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.35,0:21:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But my information is credible.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.76,0:21:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Akazaya members\Nare indeed alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.65,0:21:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OROCHI]\NI don't care if\Neveryone in this blasted country
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.19,0:21:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,thinks I've gone mad!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.73,0:21:37.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have the authority to do\Nas I please, either way!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.95,0:21:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not only did I\Ndestroy their ships,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.24,0:21:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've blocked every last\Nroute to Tokage Port.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.87,0:21:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four thousand troops?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.79,0:21:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did a splendid job.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.08,0:21:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But not a single one of them is\Nmaking it to that port tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.00,0:21:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Orochi grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.54,0:21:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OROCHI]\NYou won't even get\Na chance to exact your revenge!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.47,0:22:01.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you again,\NGhosts of Akazaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.93,0:22:03.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wallow in despair!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.76,0:22:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See how truly helpless you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.52,0:22:11.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Orochi cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.11,0:22:15.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOMONOSUKE]\NStop
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.62,0:22:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't take that boat!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.28,0:22:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you will die at sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.57,0:22:21.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you will die at sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.21,0:22:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should turn back!\NWe can regroup!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.75,0:22:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's wait for another chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.42,0:22:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NWe cannot\Nthrow away this opportunity.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.63,0:22:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NWe cannot\Nthrow away this opportunity.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.67,0:22:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The chance you speak of\Nwill not occur for another year.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.76,0:22:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The chance you speak of\Nwill not occur for another year.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.93,0:22:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.01,0:22:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NSoon, they will discover
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.09,0:22:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NSoon, they will discover that
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.09,0:22:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we've taken control of Udon.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.22,0:22:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that we've taken\Ncontrol of Udon.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.76,0:22:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There will be nowhere\Nleft for us to hide.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.97,0:22:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There will be nowhere\Nleft for us to hide.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.10,0:22:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.27,0:22:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.31,0:22:40.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido will use\Nthe full strength of his army
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.48,0:22:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido will use\Nthe full strength of his army
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.48,0:22:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to hunt down every last\Nrebel in the country.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.69,0:22:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to hunt down ever last\Nrebel in the country.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.27,0:22:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't keep\Nstealing their food.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.07,0:22:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll catch on soon enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.19,0:22:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard what happened before\Nwe departed from Kuri, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.16,0:22:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The people of Okobore\NTown believed in us
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.12,0:23:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and took the blame\Nfor our crimes.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.08,0:23:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were burned alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.12,0:23:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Among them... was my wife.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.34,0:23:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NPlease allow us to go.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.05,0:23:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.34,0:23:20.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want us to flee?\NLive in disgrace?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.26,0:23:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You would deny us\Neven our dignity?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.89,0:23:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOMONOSUKE]\NBut what will become of me?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.48,0:23:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We want you to live, of course!\NAlongside Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.57,0:23:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're saying that you\Nwant to abandon me?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.28,0:23:35.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NYour father began without
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.74,0:23:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a single supporter to his name.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.16,0:23:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were lucky.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.53,0:23:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we are grateful that\Nwe were able to meet him.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.87,0:23:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He took a bunch of fools\Nand turned them into samurai.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because he believed in us.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.96,0:23:50.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we are here as\Nretainers to our lord.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.50,0:23:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I shall proudly\Nfight in his name
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.13,0:23:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the bitter end, if need be.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.55,0:24:02.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me,\NKin'emon! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.14,0:24:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stand to\Nlose anyone else!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.02,0:24:11.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[ODEN]\NListen up, all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.19,0:24:14.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,This country has been\Nisolated for centuries.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.36,0:24:16.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,As its stewards,\Nit is a decision
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.28,0:24:19.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,deeply tied to the Kozuki Clan.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.03,0:24:21.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,But the times are changing!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.03,0:24:24.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,This world will soon\Nenter a new era.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.08,0:24:25.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Before this comes to pass,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.70,0:24:28.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,our Land of Wano must be\Nprepared to meet it.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.88,0:24:32.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We must open our borders!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.02,0:24:56.86,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe tale of Oden\Nbegins 41 years ago,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.86,0:24:58.95,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,in the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.20,0:25:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON A]\NKozuki Oden has returned!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.16,0:25:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hide your wives, quickly!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.70,0:25:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON C]\NAnd your daughters, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.38,0:25:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hide the livestock, quick!\NHide the livestock!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.41,0:25:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Women gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.68,0:25:14.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like his latest\Nescape plan must have failed.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.47,0:25:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?\NDon't you ever learn?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.73,0:25:20.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThe man was\Nwell-known in the capital,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.14,0:25:23.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,but not always well-liked.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=4}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
